    "Name": "Assassin",
    "Details": "Part of the SLDF's elite Gunslinger program, this Assassin has been taken to the extreme. It features an improved Null Signature System, and enough weapons to crack open and shred the rear of 'Mechs significantly heavier than itself. Due to the cost of the Null Signature technology, this unit never saw wider production.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.1</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Right Lower</color>",
